ncement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Protection\" title=\"Protection\">Protection +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Protection\" title=\"Protection\">Protection +3</a>:</b> Passive: +3 <a href=\"/page/Deflection_bonus\" title=\"Deflection bonus\">Deflection bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +3</a>:</b> Passive: +3 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Guards\" title=\"Guards\">Undead Guard</a> +2<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Guards\" title=\"Guards\">Undead Guard</a> +2:</b> Chance to deal 2d8 Good damage to undead when hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mournlode_Docent_(Level_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mournlode_Docent_%28Level_4%29.png/420px-Mournlode_Docent_%28Level_4%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"435\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mournlode_Docent_%28Level_4%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Mournlode_Docent_(Level_8)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Mournlode Docent (Level 8)\">Mournlode Docent (Level 8)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>Metal armor constructed from valuable purple Mournlode crystal is imbued with a protective, almost holy power. Undead are seared by it, and it protects the wearer from evil.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li>In the picture, from left to right: on <a href=\"/page/Composite_Plating\" title=\"Composite Plating\">Composite Plating</a>, on <a href=\"/page/Mithral_Body\" title=\"Mithral Body\">Mithral Body</a>, on <a hre